{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"仿射概形"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"仿射概形"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>仿射概形是同构于某个环 $A$ 的谱 $\\operatorname{spec}(A)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环化空间","text":"局部环化空间"}},{"Plain":". 它的特点是它的几何信息完全由整体函数环决定.</p>\n<p>仿射概形的范畴等价于环范畴的对偶, 这是"},{"Local":{"url":"代数-几何对偶","text":"代数–几何对偶"}},{"Plain":"的一例.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过局部环化空间</h3>\n<p>…</p>\n<h3>函子式</h3>\n<p>函子式代数几何中, 仿射概形的范畴 $\\mathsf{Aff}$ 就定义为环范畴 $\\mathsf{Ring}$ 的对偶.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>仿射化</h3>\n<p>仿射概形范畴到概形范畴的嵌入 $\\mathsf{Aff} \\to \\mathsf{Sch}$ 有左伴随 $X\\mapsto \\operatorname{Spec}\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X)$:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Sch}}(X,\\operatorname{Spec}A)\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ring}}(A,\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X))\r\n    \\\\&amp;\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\operatorname{Spec}\\Gamma(X,\\mathcal O_X),\\operatorname{Spec}A).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"拟仿射概形","text":"拟仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的仿射化又称<strong>仿射闭包</strong> (affine closure).</p>\n<h3>Serre 判别法</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设 $X$ 为拟紧"},{"Local":{"url":"拟分离概形","text":"拟分离"}},{"Plain":"概形, 则 $X$ 为仿射概形当且仅当"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":"函子\n$$\r\n\\Gamma (X,-) \\colon \\mathsf{QCoh}(X) \\to \\mathsf{Ab}\r\n$$\n正合.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射态射","text":"仿射态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶仿射性","text":"高阶仿射性"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}